WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.217 --> 00:00:03.022
- [Women] Do you know how 
many kids feel less than

00:00:03.022 --> 00:00:05.205
because they didn't have a 
chance to go to school?

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:08.072
They're not this,
they're not that.

00:00:08.072 --> 00:00:10.611
And then you look at 
someone like GaryVee

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:14.672
and he admits,
he says in public that

00:00:14.672 --> 00:00:16.731
he got D's and F's.

00:00:16.731 --> 00:00:19.175
And look at where he is now.

00:00:19.175 --> 00:00:21.235
Do you know what kind 
of hope that creates?

00:00:21.235 --> 00:00:24.134
- It's a long game. I was
told between seven years old

00:00:24.134 --> 00:00:26.121
and 18 years old that I lost.

00:00:26.121 --> 00:00:28.226
That I was a loser because
this is what I got.

00:00:28.226 --> 00:00:31.371
F City, baby. But when I 
saw F City I knew inside

00:00:31.371 --> 00:00:33.535
that this was not the game 
that I was gonna play.

00:00:33.535 --> 00:00:36.471
I was patient. I ate crow 
in that 12 year period

00:00:36.471 --> 00:00:40.166
while the market and the machine
told me I wasn't gonna win.

00:00:40.166 --> 00:00:43.579
I knew what my outcome was and
you may now be in your 20s

00:00:43.579 --> 00:00:47.243
and 30s and 40s and the machine
the marketplace might be

00:00:47.243 --> 00:00:48.788
telling you that you're going to lose

00:00:48.788 --> 00:00:50.886
but it is about 
staying the course and

00:00:50.886 --> 00:00:52.752
putting in the work and
positioning yourself

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:55.811
in the right position to
go out and win.

